    {
      "title": "The Results",
      "content": "The results show that Searchformer outperforms traditional A\u2217 search and solution-only models in solving complex planning tasks. Searchformer solves 93.7% of test tasks in the Sokoban domain, while using up to 26.8% fewer search steps than A\u2217. The model also scales better to more difficult tasks and requires fewer training sequences than solution-only models.",
