    {
      "title": "Why It Matters",
      "content": "This work demonstrates the potential of Transformers to solve complex planning tasks, and highlights the importance of incorporating search dynamics into the training process. The results have implications for the development of more efficient planning algorithms and the improvement of Large Language Models (LLMs) for multi-step reasoning tasks. <strong>Search dynamics bootstrapping</strong> provides a new approach to improving the efficiency of planning algorithms.",
